-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §125 גמולי תפקיד: a young-division head who
-- is not a first deputy gets §39's role allowances by its rules; "לעניין
-- סעיף 39(ג)" the young-division allowance is one of his two.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-39`
§ `125 גמולי תפקיד`

@ref akn:art_125__para_a
GIVEN c IS A `allowance case`
      `approved by the district manager` IS A BOOLEAN
      roles IS A LIST OF `role`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a young-division head's role allowances under §39` c `approved by the district manager` roles IS
    `the role allowances paid` c `approved by the district manager` roles

-- (ב): F-ofek-hadash-base-125-a: the cap is §39(ב), not (ג); read §39(ב)
-- (convention reading.misprint).
@ref akn:art_125__para_b
GIVEN `approved by the district manager` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `role allowances a young-division head may add` `approved by the district manager` IS
    `role allowances payable at most` `approved by the district manager` MINUS 1

`the clause 125(ב) names` MEANS "39(ג)"
`125(ב) names §39(ג) for the two-role cap` MEANS NOT (`the clause 125(ב) names` EQUALS "39(ב)")
#ASSERT `125(ב) names §39(ג) for the two-role cap`
